e/nyheter/other/vad-h\\u00e4nder-egentligen-med-ditt-blodsocker-om-du-\\u00e4ter-kiwi-varje-dag/ar-AA1PI8MT\", \"locale\": \"sv-se\", \"isLocalContent\": false, \"financeMetadata\": {\"sentimentRatings\": [{\"topic\": \"wf_sentiment_positive\", \"score\": 2003}, {\"topic\": \"wf_sentiment_negative\", \"score\": 937}, {\"topic\": \"wf_sentiment_neutral\", \"score\": 7059}]}, \"publishedDateTime\": \"2025-11-03T12:04:54Z\", \"height\": 304.0, \"wpoId\": 14, \"subCardsCount\": 0, \"isFeatured\": false, \"images\": [{\"width\": 1024, \"height\": 532, \"quality\": 100, \"url\": \"https://img-s-msn-com.akamaized.net/tenant/amp/entityid/AA1OIFOz.img\", \"attribution\": \"Shutterstock.com\", \"title\": \"Kiwi \\u2013 en frukt med kraft\", \"caption\": \"<p>Kiwi \\u00e4r inte bara god och l\\u00e4tt att ha hemma \\u2013 den har ocks\\u00e5 visat sig ha en positiv effekt p\\u00e5 tarmr\\u00f6relserna. I studien lyfts kiwi fram som ett av de mest effektiva livsmedlen mot kronisk f\\u00f6rstoppning.</p><p><strong>L\\u00e4s ocks\\u00e5</strong></p> <p>   <a href=\\\"https://www.dagens.se/livsstil/manga-svenskar-gor-misstaget-det-har-bor-du-alltid-gora-innan-du-kokar-ris\\\">    M\\u00e5nga svenskar g\\u00f6r misstaget \\u2013 det h\\u00e4r b\\u00f6r du alltid g\\u00f6ra innan du kokar ris  </a>  </p>  <p>   <a href=\\\"https://www.dagens.se/livsstil/ska-du-tvatta-klader-darfor-bor-du-inte-gora-det-i-40-grader\\\">    Ska du tv\\u00e4tta kl\\u00e4der? D\\u00e4rf\\u00f6r b\\u00f6r du inte g\\u00f6ra det i 40 grader  </a>  </p>\", \"source\": \"msn\"}], \"provider\": {\"id\": \"AA1eSMu3\", \"name\": \"Dagens.se\", \"logoUrl\": \"https://img-s-msn-com.akamaized.net/tenant/amp/entityid/AA1eSJKX.img\", \"mainLogoUrl\": \"https://img-s-msn-com.akamaized.net/tenant/amp/entityid/AA1eSJKX.img\", \"promotionalUrl\": \"https://www.dagens.se\", \"profileId\": \"vid-gsi72m85t5pw8g2ypchys0r8a62783cp5wjfnch258m73spvsqds\", \"lightThemeSVGLogo\": {\"width\": 0, \"height\": 0, \"url\": \"\"}, \"d