 kan bli brist p\\u00e5 varor. Det rusande oljepriset f\\u00e5r l\\u00e5ngtg\\u00e5ende effekter om det h\\u00e4r h\\u00e5ller i sig, enligt bed\\u00f6mare. \\u2013 Men man ska en stor portion \\u00f6dmjukhet, det h\\u00e4r utvecklas timme f\\u00f6r timme, dag f\\u00f6r dag, vi vet inte hur det h\\u00e4r utvecklas, s\\u00e4ger Torbj\\u00f6rn Isaksson, chefsanalytiker p\\u00e5 Nordea. \\u2013 Hur utdraget det h\\u00e4r blir, kommer att bli helt avg\\u00f6rande,...\", \"readTimeMin\": 2, \"url\": \"https://www.FIELD_8187a691/sv-se/ekonomi/marknader/s\\u00e5-kan-oljekrisen-sl\\u00e5-mot-pl\\u00e5nboken/ar-AA1XOgrq\", \"locale\": \"sv-se\", \"isLocalContent\": false, \"financeMetadata\": {\"stocks\": [{\"stockId\": \"an2sk2\", \"score\": 60000100}], \"sentimentRatings\": [{\"topic\": \"wf_sentiment_positive\", \"score\": 1209}, {\"topic\": \"wf_sentiment_negative\", \"score\": 8090}, {\"topic\": \"wf_sentiment_neutral\", \"score\": 699}]}, \"publishedDateTime\": \"2026-03-09T08:35:36Z\", \"subCardsCount\": 0, \"isFeatured\": false, \"images\": [{\"width\": 1024, \"height\": 663, \"quality\": 94, \"url\": \"https://img-s-msn-com.akamaized.net/tenant/amp/entityid/AA1XOgro.img\", \"attribution\": \"Pontus Lundahl/TT\", \"title\": \"Rej\\u00e4lt dyrare droppar. Men \\u00e4ven annat stiger i pris. Arkivbild.\", \"caption\": \"Rej\\u00e4lt dyrare droppar. Men \\u00e4ven annat stiger i pris. Arkivbild.\", \"source\": \"msn\"}], \"provider\": {\"id\": \"AA28Nf\", \"name\": \"TT Nyhetsbyr\\u00e5n\", \"logoUrl\": \"https://img-s-msn-com.akamaized.net/tenant/amp/entityid/AA43KF3.img\", \"mainLogoUrl\": \"https://img-s-msn-com.akamaized.net/tenant/amp/entityid/AA43KF3.img\", \"promotionalUrl\": \"https://tt.se/\", \"profileId\": \"vid-g9kw6dnkhig3ay7er9vqqf973ech3p2xve9en5jwp003ycsy4svs\", \"lightThemeSVGLogo\": {\"width\": 0, \"height\": 0, \"url\": \"\"}, \"darkThemeSVGLogo\": {\"width\": 0, \"height\": 0, \"url\": \"\"}, \"feedAllowedFreeItem\": 0}, \"category\": \"ekonomi\", \"